  "description": "<h1 data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"204\">Nintendo Switch Game – Mijn Paardenwereld | ZGAN | €11,99</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"368\">Beleef de wereld van paarden met <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"261\">Mijn Paardenwereld</strong> op de Nintendo Switch. Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"319\">ZGAN</strong> staat, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"391\">Specificaties</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<li data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"421\">Titel: Mijn Paardenwereld</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"451\">\r\n<p data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"451\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"483\">\r\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"483\">Genre: Simulatie / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"522\">Toestand: ZGAN – zo goed als nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"570\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"570\">Inclusief: Originele doos (indien aanwezig)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"604\">Plug & Play: Direct speelbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"623\">Voordelen</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<li data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"671\">Realistische paardensimulatie en verzorging</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"709\">Solo en multiplayer mogelijkheden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"732\">Direct plug & play</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"787\">Ideaal